.env*.local
# The CN build never needs these in the context: ginger.cn.yml's deploy hook
# runs locally and writes the CN values into .env.production before the build.
# Leaving them in meant `COPY . .` baked the WeChat secret and the registry
# token into the build stage — which `builder.cache: max` then exports to the
# registry's buildcache.
.env.cn.production
.env.production.sgbak
