dist
# vinext's local cache. It holds the downloaded font files AND a style.css
# whose URLs are absolute paths on whoever built it. Committed once by
# accident, it rode into the image through `COPY . .`, vinext reused it instead
# of regenerating, and every production page shipped
# url(/Users/<someone>/.../poppins-*.woff2) — a 404 for every font, site-wide.
.vinext
